flowchart TD
    Call["kernel code calls trace_sched_switch(preempt, prev, next)<br/><b>does:</b> reaches explicit TRACE_EVENT site<br/><b>state:</b> original typed args are available"]
    Gate["tracepoint dispatch<br/><b>does:</b> checks which listener families are attached<br/><b>why next:</b> avoid work for unused interfaces<br/><b>state:</b> enabled static keys select paths"]
    Copy["regular tracepoint path<br/><b>does:</b> copies configured fields into trace_event_raw_sched_switch<br/><b>why next:</b> BPF program expects stable event struct<br/><b>state:</b> ctx is copied bytes"]
    Raw["raw_tracepoint path<br/><b>does:</b> places original args into raw u64 slots<br/><b>why next:</b> BPF program unpacks by index<br/><b>state:</b> ctx->args[N] positional values"]
    BTF["tp_btf path<br/><b>does:</b> passes BTF-described args to trampoline-style wrapper<br/><b>why next:</b> BPF_PROG expects typed parameters<br/><b>state:</b> typed args valid for callback duration"]
    Return["return to scheduler<br/><b>does:</b> resumes kernel code after all attached programs finish<br/><b>state:</b> tracing side effects complete"]

    Call --> Gate
    Gate -->|tracepoint/... listener| Copy --> Return
    Gate -->|raw_tracepoint/... listener| Raw --> Return
    Gate -->|tp_btf/... listener| BTF --> Return

    classDef kern fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
